{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827333646974996","content":"Role once on each of the following tables for your loot.\n1. Elixir of Health (rare, dmg 168)\nThis translucent draught causes the air to become warm and humid when used.\n\n2. Potion of Gaseous Form (rare, dmg 187)\nA translucent serum, contained in a fragile jar.\n\n3. Potion of Greater Healing (uncommon, dmg 187)\nAn emerald ichor, contained in a cylindrical porcelain jar.\n\n4. Potion of Growth (uncommon, dmg 187)\nA thin golden potion, contained in a spherical crystal bottle.\n\n5. Potion of Growth (uncommon, dmg 187)\nA translucent liquid, contained in a crystal phial sealed with wax.\n\n6. Potion of Healing (common, dmg 187)\nThis swirling ruby admixture causes flames to turn green when used.\n\n7. Potion of Superior Healing (rare, dmg 187)\nThis yellow potion smells musty.\n\n8. Potion of Supreme Healing (very rare, dmg 187)\nA watery tincture, contained in a faceted flask.\n\n9. Potion of Water Breathing (uncommon, dmg 188)\nThis thin serum smells acidic.\n\n10. Potion of Storm Giant Strength (legendary, dmg 187)\nThis clear potion smells like cedar.","created_at":"2020-08-18T04:21:25.220000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"745135240254586881","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827333646974996","content":"1. +1 Rod of the Pact Keeper (uncommon, dmg 197)\nA thin blackthorn rod, inlaid with bloodstone.\n\n2. +2 Weapon (pike) (rare, dmg 213)\nThis masterwork weapon once belonged to the dwarf warrior Lake Styrkeson, who slew the Leviathan of the Sea of Serpents.\n\n3. +2 Weapon (shortbow) (rare, dmg 213)\nEvery strike by this weapon is accompanied by eerie silence.\n\n4. Quaal's Feather Token (whip) (rare, dmg 188)\nThis distinctive item was taken from the crypt of the lich Garica.\n\n5. Ring of Spell Turning (legendary, dmg 193)\nThis brass ring once belonged to the dwarf adventurer Hraldi, who defeated Abuk the Treacherous.\n\n6.+1 Armor (studded leather) (rare, dmg 152)\nThis masterwork armor is said to have been blessed by the Goddess of Luck herself.","created_at":"2020-08-18T04:22:41.130000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-18T04:23:20.704000Z","id":"745135558644203591","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827333646974996","content":"1. Spell Scroll (Commune) (rare, dmg 200)\n2. Spell Scroll (Gentle Repose) (uncommon, dmg 200)\n3. Spell Scroll (Locate Object) (uncommon, dmg 200)\n4. Spell Scroll (Clairvoyance) (uncommon, dmg 200)\n5. Spell Scroll (Rope Trick) (uncommon, dmg 200)\n6. Spell Scroll (True Strike) (common, dmg 200)\n7. Spell Scroll (Vampiric Touch) (uncommon, dmg 200)\n8. Spell Scroll (Water Walk) (uncommon, dmg 200)\n9. Spell Scroll (Water Walk) (uncommon, dmg 200)\n10.Spell Scroll (Wrathful Smite) (common, dmg 200)","created_at":"2020-08-18T04:24:26.366000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-18T04:25:07.983000Z","id":"745136000036241487","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
